=00_AQRQSye7vSEtgsbfVb06-skm7e_e_Ef38WGzdCHUtg1PaA&oe=6AFC5F27"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Museverse_Banner_Cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1388406682217015", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823878_1388406685550348_4461689847965399829_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iuQ1bFeEwFgQ7kNvwGM9yef&_nc_oc=AdofiIqxujjvkPZVM9HPGwTsguVUWJ4A--coS3GKp__ByiHTXE8bVVO4zM7WiPxyy2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8Br_CtKp0fMROa5tzJ14CmC8X6byvuJjdVojyOJpqJQ&oe=6AFC75FA"}, "display_name": "Museverse", "keywords": ["taiko", "music", "drums", "marimba", "learning"], "long_description": "**Transform how you learn music with Museverse \u2013 the immersive VR platform that makes music education fun, accessible, and unforgettable!**\n\n**\ud83c\udfb5 Learn Like Never Before**\n\nExperience bite-sized, gamified lessons. Master rhythm, melody, harmony, and basic instrument skills through interactive VR experiences that keep you engaged and motivated.\n\n**\ud83c\udfb8 Virtual Instruments at Your Fingertips**\n\nNo expensive equipment needed! Play realistic 3D instruments including drums, marimba, and taiko drum. Our instrument-agnostic curriculum teaches universal music concepts you can apply anywhere.\n\n**\ud83c\udfae Gamified Learning That Works**\n\nShort, engaging exercises build your musical awareness step by step. Visual, spatial music theory tasks make complex concepts easy to understand through immersive interaction.\n\n**\ud83c\udfeb Perfect for Schools & Families**\n\n- **Students**: Learn through exploration, not pressure\n- **Educators**: Bring music education into the 21st century\n- **Parents**: Give your children an affordable, safe way to explore music", "short_description": "Learn music through play! Museverse transforms music education with immersive VR lessons and interactive virtual instruments."}]}, "developer_name": 