en the intro, you now boot straight into the main space instead of replaying it every launch (first-time players still get the full intro).\n  - Marimba timing tuned \u2014 the Marimba now uses its own hit-detection window with a more forgiving \"Perfect\" timing, so mallet hits register more fairly.\n  - Accurate end-of-lesson scores \u2014 the completion percentage now reflects your real timing-weighted accuracy (it could previously read 0% on the Marimba).\n\n  \ufffd Fixes\n\n  - Fixed Lesson 8 and Lesson 9 (audio/MIDI).\n  - Results percentage now animates in sync with the radial fill on the Marimba and Taiko completion screens (was previously frozen).", "created_date": 1782423245, "id": "27507481072220387", "version": "1.8.3", "version_code": 183, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8440983862630061", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27507481072220387"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1782418265, "id": "27506823252286169", "version": "1.8.2", "version_code": 182, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8440983862630061", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27507481072220387"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1782